        "title": "The library is current, and the templates and the tutorial can stand on it",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "library-made-current",
          "nodeId": "library-made-current-goal"
        },
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/goal.node-class.node",
        "owner": "Michael",
        "body": "Every graph a visitor can reach from the front door uses the current vocabulary and has a face of its own; what is older is kept for reference and says so. Then the templates are recreated where they have to be, and the tutorial is written on top.",
        "status": "in-progress",
        "successMetrics": [
          "The front door, the library and its shelves are live and link both ways.",
          "The documents the repo treats as law are canon pages.",
          "Every contract the index lists has a face, not a miniature.",
          "The templates that need recreating are known, and recreated.",
          "The tutorial opens from the front door."
        ],
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1792950744123,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        },
        "notes": "2026-10-28: the library root, the contracts index and the links between the front door, the library and its shelves are built, pushed and linked both ways (every shelf but the legacy Node class library), and the Page Template's list bug is fixed. Waiting on a publish and a redeploy. Next, in order: the three documents of law as pages, the template audit, then the tutorial."
      }
