        "owner": "Michael",
        "status": "todo",
        "body": "AGENTS.md names three documents as authoritative: graph-native-node-composition.md, twilite-structural-model-inventory.md (both in library/documentation/contracts) and docs/twilite-native-graph-v1.md. They are markdown, so nothing can open them as a tile and the contracts index cannot list them. Rebuild each as a Page Template page (the Authoring contract page is the model), with the wording unchanged until Michael says; add them to the index. The foundation for the templates and the tutorial.",
