        "body": "Each tile of the contracts index shows a miniature of a graph of up to fifty nodes, because the contract has no face. Either a Contract template whose Method derives a page from a contract graph's own content nodes (built once, applied fourteen times), or hand pages for the few that matter. Decide after the law documents, which will show what a contract page needs.",
